# SOURCE-SHA256SUMS.txt hashes exact bytes, so all reviewable source/config
# is checked out with deterministic LF line endings on every platform.
# PowerShell runtime source is additionally kept ASCII-only for Windows PowerShell 5.1.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
Dockerfile* text eol=lf
